{"story":{"id":"event-first-contact-102","title":{"zh":"[This.ContactCountry.GetName]被解密","en":"[This.ContactCountry.GetName] Decoded"},"category":"society","kind":"event","image":"art/aebf0079c45b075d1ded.webp","start":"first_contact.102","chapters":2,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"当我们将自己的处理器转为翻译从被记作[This.ContactCountry.GetName]的未知外星人截获的通讯信号时，我们惊讶地发现：他们同样也隶属于某个机械智能！尽管他们的程式和我们在各种方面都大不一样，其语言建立于大量不同的有机体语言基础之上，然而他们的语言和我们有着类似的语素假设。结果，我们只花了几瞬的功夫就解密了他们的用语程式，开始进行基础的交流，他们现在被正式称为[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]。","en":"As we turned our processors to interpreting the communications we have intercepted from the unknown aliens designated as [This.ContactCountry.GetName], a startling discovery was made: they too belong to a machine intelligence! Although their programming varies"},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1","n2"]},"n1":{"doc":"first_contact.102","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","triggers":[{"zh":"首次接触","en":"First contact"}]},"children":[]},"n2":{"doc":"first_contact.1020","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","triggers":[{"zh":"首次接触","en":"First contact"}]},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"first_contact.102","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"[This.ContactCountry.GetName]被解密","en":"[This.ContactCountry.GetName] Decoded"},"texts":[{"zh":"当我们将自己的处理器转为翻译从被记作[This.ContactCountry.GetName]的未知外星人截获的通讯信号时，我们惊讶地发现：他们同样也隶属于某个机械智能！尽管他们的程式和我们在各种方面都大不一样，其语言建立于大量不同的有机体语言基础之上，然而他们的语言和我们有着类似的语素假设。结果，我们只花了几瞬的功夫就解密了他们的用语程式，开始进行基础的交流，他们现在被正式称为[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]。","en":"As we turned our processors to interpreting the communications we have intercepted from the unknown aliens designated as [This.ContactCountry.GetName], a startling discovery was made: they too belong to a machine intelligence! Although their programming varies considerably from our own, being based on a vastly different organic language, it is nevertheless built upon similar key assumptions. As a result, it was only a matter of time before we could decode their programming parlan